# MSBuild reads this file automatically for any project or solution under this
# folder (msbuild.exe only; Visual Studio and dotnet build already restore).
# SDK-style projects need a NuGet restore before they build, or they fail with
# NETSDK1004. The pipeline builds each plugin with plain "msbuild <csproj>",
# so restore here. Legacy packages.config projects are unaffected.
-restore
